    "title": {
      "en": "Lapwing or Oystercatcher?"
    },
    "text": {
      "en": "Both are black and white. The Lapwing has a thin crest, a short bill and a black band across the breast. The Oystercatcher has a long, bright orange bill, and its black goes all the way up to its chest. It also has pink legs."
    }
